# 26. FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS & TESTING

Do not consider the project complete merely because the pages look attractive.

Test these complete workflows:

Workflow 1: Product Creation

Admin logs in → Opens Products → Adds a new product → Uploads image → Sets price and stock → Publishes product → Product appears on storefront.

Workflow 2: Product Purchase

Customer opens store → Searches product → Opens details → Adds to cart → Goes to checkout → Provides delivery information → Places order → Receives order confirmation.

Workflow 3: Order Management

Admin opens dashboard → Receives new order → Views details → Confirms order → Updates delivery status → Customer sees updated status.

Workflow 4: Inventory

Admin adds stock → Customer purchases product → Stock updates → Low-stock notification appears when threshold is reached.

Workflow 5: Promotions

Admin creates coupon → Customer enters coupon → System validates it → Discount is applied correctly.

Workflow 6: Customer Accounts

Customer registers → Logs in → Updates profile → Views orders → Tracks purchases.

Workflow 7: Admin Permissions

Super Admin creates another admin → Assigns a role → Restricted admin can only access authorized features.

Workflow 8: Homepage Management

Admin changes banner → Saves changes → Storefront displays the updated banner.

Test all important actions, forms, buttons, navigation, validation, calculations, and error handling.

